# Thu muc goc cua TFTP: chi giu file mau, file nguoi dung up/download se khong
# bao gio duoc commit. Luu y dung `files/*` (khu viet `files/`) de cac quy tac
# `!files/...` ben duoi con hieu luc.
files/*
!files/empty.dat
!files/hello.txt
!files/sample.bin

